<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Contact Veron Crest | Plan Your Journey</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Contact Veron Crest Tours and Travels in Nepal to plan an inbound tour or outbound holiday.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css" crossorigin="anonymous">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700;800&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/tailwind.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/pages/contact.css">
</head>
<body class="contact-page bg-sand-50 text-slate-800 antialiased">
  <%- include('partials/navbar', { activePage: activePage }) %>
  <main>
    <section class="page-hero contact-hero"><div class="page-shell"><span class="eyebrow">Nepal inbound &amp; outbound travel</span><h1>Let us plan your<br><em>next journey.</em></h1><p>Share where you want to go, whether you are visiting Nepal or travelling out from Nepal. Contact details shown are sample content for now.</p></div></section>
    <section class="page-section contact-section"><div class="page-shell contact-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">We are here for you</span><h2>Your next chapter starts here.</h2><p class="story-copy">Whether you have a date in mind or only a feeling, we can turn it into a thoughtful itinerary.</p><div class="contact-details"><a href="tel:+97715550100"><i class="fa-solid fa-phone"></i><span><small>Call our concierge</small>+977 1-555-0100 (demo)</span></a><a href="mailto:hello@example.com"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i><span><small>Email us</small>hello@example.com</span></a><div><i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot"></i><span><small>Visit our studio</small>Thamel, Kathmandu, Nepal (sample)</span></div></div></div><form class="contact-form" id="contact-form"><label>Your name<input type="text" required placeholder="How should we call you?"></label><label>Email address<input type="email" required placeholder="you@example.com"></label><label>What are you dreaming about?<textarea rows="5" required placeholder="Destination, dates, occasion or simply a feeling..."></textarea></label><button class="page-button" type="submit">Send enquiry <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></button><p class="form-note" id="contact-success" hidden>Thanks — your enquiry is ready for our concierge team.</p></form></div></section>
    <section id="faq" class="page-section page-section-tint"><div class="page-shell mini-faq"><span class="eyebrow">Need an answer?</span><h2>Talk with our travel team.</h2><p>Phone and email shown on this demo site are placeholders for the client’s confirmed details.</p><div><a href="tel:+97715550100" class="text-link">Call demo number <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a><a href="mailto:hello@example.com" class="text-link">Email the demo address <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></div></div></section>
  </main>
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <script>document.getElementById('contact-form').addEventListener('submit', function (event) { event.preventDefault(); document.getElementById('contact-success').hidden = false; this.reset(); });</script>
</body>
</html>




